# herdr-git-status (ianseddon/herdr-git-status, a fork adding GST_LABEL_*): sidebar
# glyphs only, no secrets. Bare glyphs, no "CI"/"R"/"M" labels, matching gh-dash's
# PR list (dlvhdr/gh-dash v4.26.1 internal/tui/constants/constants.go). Colours are
# per state in the sidebar rows of herdr/.config/herdr/config.toml.
GST_LABEL_CI=
GST_LABEL_REVIEW=
GST_LABEL_MERGE=
# CI, as gh-dash's CI column: SuccessIcon, FailureIcon, WaitingIcon, then
# ActionRequiredIcon for checks that wait on a person and EmptyIcon for
# cancelled/skipped runs.
GST_ICON_OK=
GST_ICON_FAIL=󰅙
GST_ICON_RUN=
GST_ICON_MANUAL=
GST_ICON_NONE=
# Review: gh-dash's PersonIcon for every reviewer state, coloured by state in
# the sidebar rows (approved, changes requested, awaiting, required), so it never
# looks like a CI glyph. Conflicts and drafts are about the PR, not a reviewer:
# gh-dash's BlockedIcon and DraftIcon. (`required` uses GST_ICON_AWAITING.)
GST_ICON_CONFLICT=
GST_ICON_DRAFT=
GST_ICON_CHANGES=
GST_ICON_APPROVED=
GST_ICON_AWAITING=
# Merge, as gh-dash's state column: MergeQueueIcon and MergedIcon.
GST_ICON_AUTOMERGE=
GST_ICON_MERGED=
